*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
SORT W47962D1 TO W47962D3 +                                                     
     USING (E51-IDDISTR  +                                                      
            E51-IDKUNDNR +                                                      
            E51-IDKUNDRF)                                                       
                                                                                
*                                                                               
SORT W47962D2 TO W47962D4 +                                                     
     USING (E61-IDDISTR  +                                                      
            E61-IDKUNDNR +                                                      
            E61-IDKUNDRF)                                                       
                                                                                
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W47962D3 KEY (TMP1-IDDISTR    +                                      
                         TMP1-IDKUNDNR   +                                      
                         TMP1-IDKUNDRF)  +                                      
           W47962D4 KEY (TMP2-IDDISTR    +                                      
                         TMP2-IDKUNDNR   +                                      
                         TMP2-IDKUNDRF))                                        
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
  TMP2-TIORDREG = TMP1-TIORDREG                                                 
  TMP3-W479061  = TMP2-W479061                                                  
  TMP3-IDPTYP   = 'E62'                                                         
  PUT W47962D5                                                                  
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
SORT W47962D5 TO W47962D6  +                                                    
     USING (TMP3-IDDC      +                                                    
            TMP3-IDDISTR   +                                                    
            TMP3-KDORDKL   +                                                    
            TMP3-IDPRODNR)                                                      
